# Agent-side skill/rule/workflow/agent links (created by sync-tool-configs / setup scripts,
# NOT committed content). The CANONICAL sources live in skills/, rules/, workflows/, and
# tool-subagents/; provider dirs link to them at setup time (symlinks on Linux/macOS,
# junctions on Windows). Both the link itself and any traversed content are ignored;
# the provider README.md files stay tracked.
